                 SOUTHWESTERN PUBLIC SERVICE COMPANY’S
            NOTICE OF SUBSTITUTION OF WITNESS AND ADOPTION OF
              PREFILED TESTIMONY AND DISCOVERY RESPONSES

       Southwestern Public Service Company (“SPS”) submits this notice that, due to the

unavailability of SPS witness Tamra Newman, SPS substitutes Yen Ly, Vice President, Total

Rewards, for Xcel Energy Services Inc. Ms. Ly will adopt and serve as the sponsoring witness for

Ms. Newman’s November 20, 2025, Direct Testimony and for any discovery responses Ms.

Newman has sponsored in this proceeding.

       Ms. Ly is familiar with the contents of Ms. Newman’s pre-filed testimony and discovery

responses and will adopt them in full, except for the “Witness Identification and Qualifications”

section, which will be replaced. A revised qualifications page for Ms. Ly is attached to this Notice

as Exhibit A. Ms. Ly is qualified to testify on the subject matter of Ms. Newman’s testimony and

discovery responses, and will be available to sponsor them and respond to questions at the

evidentiary hearing scheduled to begin on July 13, 2026.




